# __DISTRIBUTION__

Python 3.11+ library. Install `__DISTRIBUTION__` and import `__IMPORT__`.
This maintainer scaffold has no runtime functionality yet. Define its purpose,
public API, platform support, and application ownership boundaries before release.

```sh
python -m pip install .
python examples/quickstart.py
```

See [documentation](docs/README.md) and [maintainer setup](docs/development.md).
Ordinary reports go through the integrating product. External contributions are
not currently accepted due to limited capacity. See [reporting](../docs/reporting.md)
and [private security reporting](../SECURITY.md).
